@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix saref: <https://saref.etsi.org/core/> .

<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://saref.etsi.org/core/> .

<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/SmartGridMeter> a owl:Class .
<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/MeterProperty> a owl:Class .
<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/ProfileGeneric> a owl:Class .
<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/AgenticDevice> a owl:Class .

<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/Property__Definition__s4grid> rdfs:subClassOf <https://saref.etsi.org/core/Device> .
<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/SmartGridMeter> rdfs:subClassOf <https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/AgenticDevice> .
<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/MeterProperty> rdfs:subClassOf <https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property> .
<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/Property> owl:equivalentClass <https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property> .
<https://saref.etsi.org/saref4grid/Property__Definition__s4grid> owl:equivalentClass <https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property> .
